    "title": "Deploy a Live Update",
    "description": "Learn how to deploy a live update to your app using Capgo's Live Updates feature, enabling real-time UI and logic updates without app store resubmission.",
    "sidebar": {
      "order": 4
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 3,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 3,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Use Capgo's Live Updates feature to update the UI and business logic of your app remotely, in real-time. Push JS bundle updates directly to your users without going through the app store to instantly fix bugs and ship new features."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "component",
      "name": "Aside",
      "props": {
        "type": "tip"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 6,
                "column": 1
              },
              "text": "Capgo uploads the generated web build folder. HTML, CSS, JavaScript, assets, and pure-JavaScript package changes can go OTA once they are bundled there. Changes to "
            },
            {
              "type": "inlineCode",
              "location": {
                "line": 6,
                "column": 165
              },
              "text": "capacitor.config.ts"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 6,
                "column": 186
              },
              "text": ", native plugin configuration, native packages, or iOS/Android project files require a native app release."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "location": {
        "line": 5,
        "column": 1
      }
    },
